### 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jaehoon"
}

### 없는 이름으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hana"
}

### 나는 누구
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### 쿠키를 고쳐서 보내면
# @no-cookie-jar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Cookie: userId=1

### 헤더로 보내면
# @no-cookie-jar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer 1

### 쿠키를 고쳐서 보내면
# @no-cookie-jar
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Cookie: sessionId=1

### 로그아웃
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout

### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrPhone": "sora@example.com",
  "name": "한소라",
  "username": "sora",
  "password": "sora1234"
}

### 전화번호로 회원가입
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrPhone": "010-1234-5678",
  "name": "피카츄",
  "username": "pikachu",
  "password": "pikachu1234"
}

### 이미 있는 사용자 이름으로 가입
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrPhone": "jaehoon@example.com",
  "name": "김재훈",
  "username": "jaehoon",
  "password": "jaehoon1234"
}

### 사용자 이름 중복 확인
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/check-duplicate?type=username&value=sora

### 휴대폰 번호 중복 확인
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/check-duplicate?type=phone&value=010-1234-5677